<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Notification small icon.

    Monochrome and alpha-only on purpose: Android silhouettes the small icon,
    so every non-transparent pixel is painted the system's accent colour and any
    colour declared here is discarded. The spike used @mipmap/ic_launcher and
    rendered as a featureless white blob, which is what that rule does to a
    full-colour asset.

    A check inside a circle, matching the ✓ the app already uses for a completed
    occurrence — status is never carried by colour alone anywhere in Riyaz, and
    the notification tray is no exception.
-->
